## Decisions

### DL-01 — Registration shell mode

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| **Status** | **PENDING SIGN-OFF** |
| **Context** | P6-3 conversion focus; SMK-PTL-06; PCMS-REG-01 resume on register page only. |
| **Decision** | Minimal shell on `/catalog/{tourId}/register`; full shell on all `/me/*`. Registration excluded from member registry. |
| **Consequences** | Registration never shows bottom nav; graduation to full shell at `/me/*`. |
| **Dependencies** | PCMS-REG-01; §9 registration policy |
| **Open questions** | None — closed in blueprint. |

### DL-02 — Hub / Profile placement (Denali reference IA)

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| **Status** | **PENDING SIGN-OFF** |
| **Context** | Five touch targets; profile is not a daily-switch tab. |
| **Decision** | Bottom nav: Home · Trips · Wallet · Membership · More. Profile in user menu only. |
| **Consequences** | Denali reference binding; other workspaces may differ within cap rules. |
| **Dependencies** | DL-04; §22 Denali reference |
| **Open questions** | Per-workspace IA override rules beyond Denali. |

### DL-03 — Trips route naming

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| **Status** | **PENDING SIGN-OFF** |
| **Context** | Avoids WRS confusion with marketing `/tours`; SMK-PTL backward compatibility. |
| **Decision** | Registry module id `trips`; route `/me/registrations` retained as permanent alias. |
| **Consequences** | SMK-PTL-02/04/05 keep `/me/registrations` href; label uses trips semantics. |
| **Dependencies** | DL-06; WRS-PATH-01/02; URL freeze §48 |
| **Open questions** | None. |

### DL-04 — Primary nav overflow (>5 modules)

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| **Status** | **PENDING SIGN-OFF** |
| **Context** | Mirrors `validateSettingsManifest` strictness. |
| **Decision** | Codegen hard fail if >5 primary tier modules declared. |
| **Consequences** | Forces explicit secondary/hidden tiering. |
| **Dependencies** | Operator settings registry pattern |
| **Open questions** | None. |

### DL-05 — Shared public navigation source

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| **Status** | **PENDING SIGN-OFF** |
| **Context** | Duplication in `marketing-shell.tsx` L21–26. |
| **Decision** | New manifest block `guestCrossSurfaceNav` replaces hardcoded `FULL_LANDING_NAV_LINKS`. |
| **Consequences** | Phase 3 delivers manifest-driven marketing + portal header egress. |
| **Dependencies** | DL-37; WRS addendum |
| **Open questions** | None — see [guest-cross-surface-nav-schema.mdoc](./guest-cross-surface-nav-schema.mdoc). |

### DL-06 — Default authenticated portal entry

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| **Status** | **PENDING SIGN-OFF** |
| **Context** | Today `apps/portal/app/page.tsx` L12 → `/me/registrations`. |
| **Decision** | `defaultPrimaryModuleId` in member registry replaces hardcoded redirect in `app/page.tsx`. |
| **Consequences** | Portal `/` redirect becomes registry-driven; alias path preserved. |
| **Dependencies** | DL-03; DL-22 |
| **Open questions** | None. |

### DL-07 — Guest conformance L4

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| **Status** | **PENDING SIGN-OFF** |
| **Context** | Urban/starter remain L3 until member app needed. |
| **Decision** | L4 = L3 + `memberPortal` registry block required for member-app label. |
| **Consequences** | Conformance codegen gains L4 tier. |
| **Dependencies** | DL-18; guest-plugin-conformance.md |
| **Open questions** | Exact L4 CI fail timing. |

### DL-08 — Marketing logged-in indicator

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| **Status** | **PENDING SIGN-OFF** |
| **Context** | Marketing must not read member session. |
| **Decision** | No — egress link only per PCMS-001. |
| **Consequences** | Static link via GSH; no authenticated marketing UI. |
| **Dependencies** | PCMS-001; guard-pcms-authority |
| **Open questions** | None — permanent (RA-02). |

### DL-09 — Entitlement wire format

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| **Status** | **PENDING SIGN-OFF** |
| **Context** | Matches `/api/me/*` + `buildMemberApiHeaders`. |
| **Decision** | `GET /api/me/entitlements` portal BFF; not JWT embed; not client-only. |
| **Consequences** | Shell SSR intersects registry with entitlements. |
| **Dependencies** | DL-23; middleware; entitlements mdoc (future) |
| **Open questions** | Upstream API field names (Phase 5 impl PR). Contract: [platform-portal-member-entitlements.mdoc](../platform-portal-member-entitlements.mdoc). |

### DL-10 — Hub virtualisation threshold

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| **Status** | **PENDING SIGN-OFF** |
| **Context** | Navigation IA stability at scale. |
| **Decision** | Plain hub list until 25 secondary modules; virtualised list at 25+ (Phase 7). |
| **Consequences** | Phase 7 performance work. |
| **Dependencies** | DL-02; §12 scalability |
| **Open questions** | Virtualisation UX details deferred to Phase 7. |

### DL-11 — Module deprecation

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| **Status** | **PENDING SIGN-OFF** |
| **Context** | No silent route removal. |
| **Decision** | `moduleVersion` in manifest + RFC sunset note; SMK updated on removal. |
| **Consequences** | Sunset process required. |
| **Dependencies** | DL-28; SMK matrix |
| **Open questions** | Deprecation HTTP headers optional. |

### DL-12 — returnUrl / portalReturn contract

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| **Status** | **PENDING SIGN-OFF** |
| **Context** | MAP §3.6 intent; prevents open redirect. |
| **Decision** | Query `portalReturn` on register egress; allowlist relative paths on marketing host only. |
| **Consequences** | Not implemented in repo today. |
| **Dependencies** | PCMS; MIGRATION-MAP §3.6 |
| **Open questions** | Implementation phase for portalReturn. |

### DL-13 — Telegram / embedded host adapter

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| **Status** | **PENDING SIGN-OFF** |
| **Context** | URL + host concerns stay one package. |
| **Decision** | Extend `@app-tour/guest-surface-host` with embedded-host exports; no portal fork. |
| **Consequences** | Phase 6 adapter. |
| **Dependencies** | DL-16 |
| **Open questions** | Adapter API surface in Phase 6. |

### DL-14 — Phase 7 search ownership

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| **Status** | **PENDING SIGN-OFF** |
| **Context** | Prevents global search of operator/finance rows. |
| **Decision** | Platform indexes registry metadata; workspace indexes module content internally. |
| **Consequences** | Phase 7 only. |
| **Dependencies** | DL-15 |
| **Open questions** | Search UI ownership. |

### DL-15 — Member wallet vs operator finance

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| **Status** | **PENDING SIGN-OFF** |
| **Context** | Denali `httpRoutes` finance is operator-scoped (`apps/api` `/finance/*`). |
| **Decision** | Separate member finance HTTP routes; member BFF proxies; actor=member RLS. Never portal BFF to operator `/finance/*`. |
| **Consequences** | Wallet module uses member-scoped API only. |
| **Dependencies** | BF-02; Denali manifest |
| **Open questions** | Member finance route design per workspace. |

### DL-16 — Embedded host package location

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| **Status** | **PENDING SIGN-OFF** |
| **Context** | Same as DL-13. |
| **Decision** | Subpath of guest-surface-host, not new monorepo app. |
| **Consequences** | Single package for cross-surface + embedded URLs. |
| **Dependencies** | DL-13 |
| **Open questions** | None. |

### DL-17 — Entitlement BFF cache TTL

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| **Status** | **PENDING SIGN-OFF** |
| **Context** | SR-03; profile cache precedent. |
| **Decision** | Phase 5: TTL=0. Phase 7: optional 30s private BFF cache; invalidate on logout + membership mutation. |
| **Consequences** | API always re-checks on mutation. |
| **Dependencies** | DL-09; member-profile-cache.server.ts |
| **Open questions** | Exact TTL tuning in Phase 7. |

### DL-18 — L4 enforcement strictness

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| **Status** | **PENDING SIGN-OFF** |
| **Context** | OQ-02 closed in blueprint. |
| **Decision** | Phase 2: codegen warn if L3 declares `memberPortal`. Phase 5: CI fail if Denali lacks block. Urban/starter exempt. |
| **Consequences** | Phased conformance enforcement. |
| **Dependencies** | DL-07; generate-workspace-registry |
| **Open questions** | None. |

### DL-19 — Member home data architecture

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| **Status** | **PENDING SIGN-OFF** |
| **Context** | OQ-03 closed. |
| **Decision** | `GET /api/me/home` BFF aggregates upstreams — server composition. |
| **Consequences** | Phase 4 home module. |
| **Dependencies** | DL-09; DL-31 allowlist |
| **Open questions** | Aggregate response shape in Phase 4. |

### DL-20 — Notifications module

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| **Status** | **PENDING SIGN-OFF** |
| **Context** | OQ-04 closed. |
| **Decision** | Phase 1–6: header badge slot. Phase 7: optional hidden `notifications` module. |
| **Consequences** | Avoids premature registry bloat. |
| **Dependencies** | DL-02 |
| **Open questions** | Badge BFF timing. |

### DL-21 — Unauthorized module deep link

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| **Status** | **PENDING SIGN-OFF** |
| **Context** | Preserves member session. |
| **Decision** | 403 in-portal page + BFF JSON deny — not marketing redirect. |
| **Consequences** | Distinct unauthorized UX. |
| **Dependencies** | DL-09; §41 dispatcher |
| **Open questions** | 403 body codes. |

### DL-22 — GSH member area URL

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| **Status** | **PENDING SIGN-OFF** |
| **Context** | Hardcoded `/me/registrations` at `resolve-portal-public-base-url.ts` L19–20. |
| **Decision** | Add `resolvePortalMemberModuleUrl(host, moduleId?)`; deprecated `resolvePortalMemberAreaUrl` delegated PS-3..PS-6; **removed PS-7 (CL-01)**. |
| **Consequences** | All cross-host member links use registry-aware builder only. |
| **Dependencies** | DL-06; DL-38; URL freeze |
| **Open questions** | None — see [builder-migration-contract.mdoc](./builder-migration-contract.mdoc). |

### DL-23 — Shell bootstrap fetch order

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| **Status** | **PENDING SIGN-OFF** |
| **Context** | Avoid N+1 SSR. |
| **Decision** | SSR: bootstrap → registry → entitlements BFF → nav; module outlet parallel. |
| **Consequences** | Performance contract. |
| **Dependencies** | DL-09; header propagation §40 |
| **Open questions** | Optional coalesce in Phase 7. |

