| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| **Status** | **PENDING SIGN-OFF** |
| **Context** | Static folders do not scale to 50 modules. |
| **Decision** | Single `app/me/[[...modulePath]]/page.tsx` dispatcher beyond Phase 5. |
| **Consequences** | Phase 5+ only. |
| **Dependencies** | DL-28; NS-03 |
| **Open questions** | Dispatcher implementation details. |

