| **Context** | Footer uses `portalMemberAreaUrl` today. |
| **Decision** | Same GSH resolver as header — track `defaultPrimaryModuleId`. |
| **Consequences** | Header/footer parity. |
| **Dependencies** | DL-22; marketing-footer.tsx |
| **Open questions** | None. |

