### DL-28 — Catch-all vs static routes

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| **Status** | **PENDING SIGN-OFF** |
| **Context** | NS-03 shadow risk. |
| **Decision** | Phase 1–4 static only. Phase 5+ dispatcher; static wins. |
| **Consequences** | Phased adoption. |
| **Dependencies** | DL-24; §41 coexistence |
| **Open questions** | Reserved path table in codegen. |

### DL-29 — SSR failure UX

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| **Status** | **PENDING SIGN-OFF** |
| **Context** | ERR-01; SS-01. |
| **Decision** | Degraded shell + retry — never silent empty nav. |
| **Consequences** | Support diagnosability. |
| **Dependencies** | DL-09; observability §33 |
| **Open questions** | Error code taxonomy. |

### DL-30 — Reserved module ids

| Field | Value |
| ----- | ----- |
| **Status** | **PENDING SIGN-OFF** |
| **Context** | NS-01; NS-04; Denali IA includes platform Home module at `/me/home`. |
| **Decision** | **Platform-owned id:** `home` — workspace manifests MUST NOT declare moduleId `home`. **Namespace-reserved:** `more`, `api`, `catalog` — codegen blocklist. |
| **Consequences** | Platform delivers `/me/home` (BP-4); workspaces reference `home` via effective registry merge only. No conflict with URL freeze alias `/me/registrations`. Validation via `guard-member-module-id-reserved`. |
| **Dependencies** | DL-02; DL-19; RFC §4.3.1; WRS addendum §3.1 |
| **Open questions** | Additional namespace-reserved ids only. |

